#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "Controls"
msgstr "Styring"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"One client runs on a desktop, a phone and a headset, so every action has a "
"way in from each of them. The keyboard has the most; touch, a gamepad and "
"the XR controllers carry the actions a match needs, and the Settings menu "
"reaches the rest -- including from a headset, where there is no keyboard at "
"all. This page is also the in-game help's (`/` or `?`)."
msgstr ""
"Én klient kører på en computer, en telefon og et headset, så hver handling "
"kan nås fra dem alle. Tastaturet har flest; touch, en gamepad og XR-"
"controllerne dækker de handlinger, en kamp kræver, og menuen Indstillinger "
"når resten -- også fra et headset, hvor der slet ikke er noget tastatur. "
"Denne side er også spillets hjælp (`/` eller `?`)."

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "Keyboard"
msgstr "Tastatur"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"Keys are named by where they sit on a US keyboard, and bzo reads them by "
"position, not by the letter printed on them. On another layout a key named "
"here is the one in the same place: `Z` is the key labelled W on a French "
"keyboard and Y on a German one."
msgstr ""

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"The numeric keypad works as in BZFlag. With Num Lock off its keys are the "
"ones printed under the digits: the arrows drive, `1` is `End`, `9` and `3` "
"are `Page Up` and `Page Down`, and `.` is `Delete`. With Num Lock on, a "
"keypad key is the main key with the same character. Keypad `Enter` shoots "
"either way."
msgstr ""
"Det numeriske tastatur virker som i BZFlag. Med Num Lock slået fra er dets "
"taster dem, der står under tallene: pilene kører, `1` er `End`, `9` og `3` "
"er `Page Up` og `Page Down`, og `.` er `Delete`. Med Num Lock slået til er "
"en tast på det numeriske tastatur hovedtasten med samme tegn. `Enter` på det "
"numeriske tastatur skyder i begge tilfælde."

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "Driving"
msgstr "Kørsel"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "`W` / `S` or `Up` / `Down` — move forward/backward"
msgstr "`W` / `S` eller `Up` / `Down` — kør frem/tilbage"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "`A` / `D` or `Left` / `Right` — turn left/right"
msgstr "`A` / `D` eller `Left` / `Right` — drej til venstre/højre"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "`Enter` — shoot"
msgstr "`Enter` — skyd"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "`Tab` — jump"
msgstr "`Tab` — hop"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "`Space` — drop flag"
msgstr "`Space` — smid flaget"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`I` or right-click — identify the tank in your sights, and lock a Guided "
"Missile onto it"
msgstr ""
"`I` eller højreklik — identificér kampvognen i dit sigte, og lås et Guided "
"Missile på den"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`Delete` — self-destruct, after a five second countdown; `Delete` again "
"calls it off"
msgstr ""
"`Delete` — selvdestruktion efter fem sekunders nedtælling; `Delete` igen "
"afblæser den"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`9` or `/autopilot [roger|ace]` — autopilot: the pilot drives, aims and "
"shoots until pressed again. `Settings -> Autopilot` chooses the pilot "
"without a keyboard. You can still drive while it does, to help it out of a "
"corner -- see [Combining inputs](#combining-inputs)"
msgstr ""
"`9` eller `/autopilot [roger|ace]` — autopilot: piloten kører, sigter og "
"skyder, indtil du trykker igen. `Settings -> Autopilot` vælger piloten uden "
"tastatur. Du kan stadig køre imens for at hjælpe den ud af et hjørne -- se "
"[Kombinere input](#combining-inputs)"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "`P` — pause/resume"
msgstr "`P` — pause/fortsæt"

#: docs/help/controls.md
