#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"Drag across the history while chat is open to select it, then copy; typing "
"carries on in the input"
msgstr ""
"Træk hen over historikken, mens chatten er åben, for at markere og kopiere; "
"det, du skriver, fortsætter i inputfeltet"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"Chat in another language arrives in yours where the browser can translate it "
"on the device: `Show original` beside a translated line shows the words as "
"written, and `Translate` fetches a language the first time it is needed"
msgstr ""

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "View and panels"
msgstr "Visning og paneler"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`Esc` — back out one step: exit chat input, leave fullscreen, leave mouse "
"steering, then open Settings. Pressing it again closes Settings, so it is "
"always safe to press one more time"
msgstr ""
"`Esc` — gå et trin tilbage: forlad chatfeltet, forlad fuld skærm, slå "
"musestyring fra og åbn derefter Indstillinger. Trykker du igen, lukkes "
"Indstillinger, så det er altid sikkert at trykke én gang til"

#: docs/help/controls.md
#, fuzzy
msgid "`Shift`+`M` — toggle mouse steering"
msgstr "`M` — slå musestyring til/fra"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid "`C` — cycle camera mode"
msgstr "`C` — skift kameratilstand"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`B` — binoculars: narrow the view to a quarter, and back. `Ctrl` and the "
"wheel narrow or widen it a step at a time. Turning with the keys slows to "
"match"
msgstr ""
"`B` — kikkert: gør synsfeltet en fjerdedel så bredt og tilbage igen. `Ctrl` "
"og hjulet gør det smallere eller bredere et trin ad gangen. Drejning med "
"tasterne bliver tilsvarende langsommere"

#: docs/help/controls.md
msgid ""
"`X` — slow keyboard: driving and turning with the keys go at half speed, and "
"back"
msgstr ""
"`X` — langsomt tastatur: kørsel og drejning med tasterne går med halv fart, "
"og tilbage"

